<h2>What this page can and cannot tell you</h2>
<p>This page does not quote a rating, grade or accreditation status from the Better Business Bureau. If you want to verify any business independently, search for it on the Better Business Bureau website and read what is listed there, including complaints and how they were resolved. For background on the organization, see the <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Better_Business_Bureau" target="_blank" rel="noopener">overview of the Better Business Bureau on Wikipedia</a>.</p>
<p>Seat Outlet is a resale marketplace. Prices are set by sellers and may be above or below face value, so compare seats and the full cost for your event. Our guide to <a href="/why-are-concert-tickets-so-expensive">why concert tickets cost what they do</a> explains what drives prices.</p>
<p>Delivery may be electronic, a mobile transfer or physical shipping, depending on the event and the seller. If something goes wrong, the <a href="/worry-free-guarantee">guarantee page</a> explains what is covered and the <a href="/ticket-customer-service">contact page</a> shows how to reach us. For feedback, see our <a href="/seat-outlet-reviews">reviews page</a>.</p>
